Package: itshield-antivirus
Version: VERSION
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ITShield Team <security@itshield.local>
Installed-Size: 5000
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, libyara-dev
Recommends: python3-pyside6, python3-inotify-simple, python3-cryptography
Section: security
Priority: optional
Description: ITShield Antivirus - Endpoint Protection Platform
 A modular antivirus + EDR framework for Linux with:
 .
  * Hash, Signature, YARA, and PE-based malware detection
  * Real-time file protection (inotify)
  * Process and network monitoring (/proc)
  * Quarantine engine with secure delete and rollback
  * Correlation engine for incident detection
  * Behavior analyzer (ransomware, persistence, C2 beaconing)
  * 12 curated YARA rule sources + abuse.ch IOC feeds
  * Ed25519 signed update verification
  * Sandbox analyzer for suspicious file triage
  * Full RTL GUI with system tray
  * HTML/JSON/text reporting
  * systemd service integration
